    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You manage your island on a map by putting various pins at different locations to scout areas and gather resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496900/extras/9baeb75d56e44e883f821485811b162d.avif?t=1746257104\" width=276 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can buy special pins that give you bonus effects, such as sell resources for more money, or get more money each time you scout. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496900/extras/9e35de8d1235a0f72d110a024aa89b7f.avif?t=1746257104\" width=264 height=294 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can buy more pins in the shop to help you gather and scout more. You can also sell resources to help you make more money so that you can pass to the next round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496900/extras/4b0a6d77ad95107d0002180a06711677.avif?t=1746257104\" width=628 height=596 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You manage your island on a map by putting various pins at different locations to scout areas and gather resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496900/extras/9baeb75d56e44e883f821485811b162d.avif?t=1746257104\" width=276 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can buy special pins that give you bonus effects, such as sell resources for more money, or get more money each time you scout. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496900/extras/9e35de8d1235a0f72d110a024aa89b7f.avif?t=1746257104\" width=264 height=294 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can buy more pins in the shop to help you gather and scout more. You can also sell resources to help you make more money so that you can pass to the next round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496900/extras/4b0a6d77ad95107d0002180a06711677.avif?t=1746257104\" width=628 height=596 /></span></p>",
